---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> Cycle

    state "Traffic Cycle (Normal or Adaptive)" as Cycle

    Cycle     --> EMERGENCY : RFID scan / API trigger
    EMERGENCY --> Cycle     : 5 s elapsed\n(15 s cooldown)

    Cycle    --> OVERRIDE : API setOverride(dir)
    OVERRIDE --> Cycle    : API clearOverride()

    note right of EMERGENCY
        All roads RED for 5 s.
        15 s cooldown before
        re-trigger is allowed.
    end note

    note left of OVERRIDE
        Selected direction stays
        green indefinitely until
        cleared.
    end note